# Copy to .dev.vars (never committed) to sign in with Google on `pnpm dev`.
# The Google client is the preview one (docs/specs/m2.md, "What you create yourself"); it
# accepts http://localhost:5173/api/auth/callback/google. No AUTH_PROXY_URL here: locally,
# Google answers directly.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=
BETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:5173
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
